#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "A Redis object-cache activation is already pending verification."
msgstr "Aktivering af Redis-objektcachen afventer allerede verifikation."

#: includes/class-yperf-product-progress.php
msgid "A YPerf optimization is enabled and proven"
msgstr "En YPerf-optimering er aktiveret og verificeret"

#: includes/class-yperf-migration-journey.php
msgid "A clean baseline was captured before migration."
msgstr "En ren basisstatus blev gemt før migreringen."

#: includes/class-yperf-ai-advisor.php
msgid ""
"A clean current-version Runtime Acceptance is required before AI-assisted "
"configuration can be applied."
msgstr ""
"En vellykket driftsgodkendelse for den aktuelle version er påkrævet, før AI-"
"assisteret konfiguration kan anvendes."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-operation-contract.php
msgid ""
"A clean current-version Runtime Acceptance is required before the R3 object-"
"cache activation can be approved."
msgstr ""
"En vellykket driftsgodkendelse for den aktuelle version er påkrævet, før "
"aktivering af R3-objektcachen kan godkendes."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A compact guide for the provider workflow. No Cloudflare expertise is "
"required."
msgstr ""
"En kort vejledning til udbyderens arbejdsgang. Kendskab til Cloudflare er "
"ikke nødvendigt."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid ""
"A drop-in exists but WordPress did not confirm an active external object "
"cache."
msgstr ""
"Der findes et drop-in, men WordPress har ikke bekræftet en aktiv ekstern "
"objektcache."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid "A drop-in exists. Ownership must be known before YPerf adopts page caching."
msgstr ""
"Der findes et drop-in. Ejerskabet skal afklares, før YPerf overtager "
"sidecachen."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid "A feature depending on this extension may be limited."
msgstr "En funktion, der afhænger af denne udvidelse, kan være begrænset."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A hot-cache HIT sample failed and automatic rollback could not be confirmed."
" Stop and review the cache artifact before continuing."
msgstr ""
"En prøve med cache-HIT fra opvarmet cache mislykkedes, og automatisk "
"tilbagerulning kunne ikke bekræftes. Stop, og gennemgå cachekomponenten, før"
" du fortsætter."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A hot-cache HIT sample failed during stability measurement. The new "
"activation was rolled back automatically."
msgstr ""
"En prøve med cache-HIT fra opvarmet cache mislykkedes under "
"stabilitetsmålingen. Den nye aktivering blev automatisk rullet tilbage."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A hot-cache HIT sample failed while re-proving an existing executor. The "
"pre-existing cache was not removed automatically and requires review."
msgstr ""
"En prøve med cache-HIT fra opvarmet cache mislykkedes ved fornyet "
"verifikation af en eksisterende cachemekanisme. Den tidligere cache blev "
"ikke fjernet automatisk og skal gennemgås."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A local under-the-hood report that combines WordPress, runtime, cache, "
"application and acceptance evidence. Nothing is sent remotely."
msgstr ""
"En lokal teknisk rapport, der samler dokumentation om WordPress, "
"driftsmiljø, cache, applikation og godkendelse. Intet sendes til eksterne "
"servere."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A material performance regression repeated on the confirmation pass. YPerf "
"rolled the profile back automatically."
msgstr ""
"En væsentlig ydelsesforringelse gentog sig ved bekræftelseskontrollen. YPerf"
" rullede automatisk profilen tilbage."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A memory engine may be available, but WordPress has not confirmed an adopted"
" persistent object-cache execution layer."
msgstr ""
"En hukommelsesmotor kan være tilgængelig, men WordPress har ikke bekræftet, "
"at en vedvarende objektcache er overtaget."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A native page-cache adoption record already exists. YPerf will not activate "
"a second page-cache executor until that authority is reviewed or released."
msgstr ""
"Der findes allerede en registrering af overtagelse af den indbyggede "
"sidecache. YPerf aktiverer ikke endnu en sidecachemekanisme, før ansvaret er"
" gennemgået eller frigivet."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A new activation rolls back automatically if cache proof or Runtime "
"Acceptance fails."
msgstr ""
"En ny aktivering rulles automatisk tilbage, hvis cacheverifikation eller "
"driftsgodkendelse mislykkes."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A no-change planning surface built from WordPress evidence plus the optional"
" host snapshot. Explicit execution lives in the dedicated adoption/operation"
" cards and remains gated by ownership, proof and rollback contracts."
msgstr ""
"Et planlægningsområde uden ændringer, baseret på WordPress-dokumentation og "
"et valgfrit øjebliksbillede af værten. Eksplicit udførelse sker i de særlige"
" kort for overtagelse og drift og forudsætter afklaret ejerskab, "
"dokumentation og en aftale om tilbagerulning."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"A previous adoption record exists, but current proof no longer matches or is"
" stale. Re-prove execution before treating the adoption as current."
msgstr ""
"Der findes en tidligere overtagelsesregistrering, men den aktuelle "
"dokumentation stemmer ikke længere eller er forældet. Verificer udførelsen "
"igen, før overtagelsen betragtes som aktuel."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A provider-owned advanced-cache.php can still block blind manual removal. "
"The transactional handover deactivates the provider first, reconciles YPerf "
"ownership, proves execution, and automatically restores the previous "
"provider if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"En advanced-cache.php, som udbyderen administrerer, kan stadig forhindre "
"ukritisk manuel fjernelse. Den transaktionssikre overdragelse deaktiverer "
"først udbyderen, afstemmer YPerfs ejerskab, verificerer udførelsen og "
"gendanner automatisk den tidligere udbyder, hvis kontrollen fejler."

msgid ""
"A provider-owned advanced-cache.php can still block blind removal. YPerf "
"prepares a reversible handoff, but you control W3 Total Cache activation on "
"the normal Plugins screen. After your confirmation, YPerf reconciles "
"ownership and proves the replacement."
msgstr ""
"En advanced-cache.php, som udbyderen administrerer, kan stadig blokere "
"ukritisk fjernelse. YPerf forbereder en reversibel overdragelse, men du "
"styrer aktivering af W3 Total Cache på den normale pluginside. Efter din "
"bekræftelse afstemmer YPerf ejerskabet og verificerer erstatningen."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A read-only site health check. It verifies public routes, cache safety and "
"origin behavior without changing settings."
msgstr ""
"En skrivebeskyttet kontrol af webstedets tilstand. Den verificerer "
"offentlige ruter, cachesikkerhed og oprindelsesserverens adfærd uden at "
"ændre indstillinger."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"A score is diagnostic evidence, not a cache engine. YPerf should explain why"
" a page is slow and which layer owns the cost."
msgstr ""
"En score er et diagnostisk resultat, ikke en cachemotor. YPerf bør forklare,"
" hvorfor en side er langsom, og hvilket lag der er ansvarligt for "
"belastningen."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "A second pass prevents one noisy sample from triggering rollback by itself."
msgstr ""
"En anden kontrol forhindrer, at en enkelt støjfyldt måling alene udløser "
"tilbagerulning."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A technical map of YPerf and detected acceleration layers. Use Optimize or "
"Settings for normal on/off control."
msgstr ""
"Et teknisk kort over YPerf og registrerede accelerationslag. Brug Optimer "
"eller Indstillinger til almindelig aktivering og deaktivering."

