msgstr "Overtag den eksisterende grænse for PHP-FPM-arbejdsprocesser"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Adopting Cloudflare profile…"
msgstr "Cloudflare-profil overtages…"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Adoption Mode"
msgstr "Overtagelsestilstand"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Adoption can still be useful: it establishes YPerf ownership and enables "
"synchronized Cloudflare purge without rewriting settings that already match."
msgstr ""
"Overtagelse kan stadig være nyttig: Den fastlægger YPerfs ejerskab og "
"muliggør synkroniseret rydning af Cloudflare-cachen uden at overskrive "
"indstillinger, der allerede stemmer."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Adoption current"
msgstr "Overtagelsen er aktuel"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Adoption is a local authority record only. Nginx config, cache files, "
"provider settings and service state remain untouched."
msgstr ""
"Overtagelsen er kun en lokal registrering af ansvar. Nginx-konfiguration, "
"cachefiler, udbyderindstillinger og tjenestestatus forbliver uændrede."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Adoption readiness"
msgstr "Klar til overtagelse"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avanceret"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
