msgstr "PHP Redis-udvidelsen er ikke tilgængelig i denne anmodning."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"The Page Cache campaign step is out of sequence. Start a fresh campaign "
"instead of skipping safety gates."
msgstr ""
"Trinnet i sidecacheforløbet er i forkert rækkefølge. Start et nyt forløb i "
"stedet for at springe sikkerhedskontroller over."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The Page Cache drop-in path is a symlink. Artifact refresh is blocked for "
"review."
msgstr ""
"Stien til sidecachens drop-in er et symbolsk link. Opdatering af komponenten"
" er blokeret til gennemgang."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
