msgstr "Stabilitetsforløbet for sidecache kører ikke i øjeblikket."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The Page Cache stability campaign stopped safely."
msgstr "Stabilitetsforløbet for sidecache blev stoppet sikkert."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The Redis activation contract changed before approval. Refresh Setup and "
"review the current contract."
msgstr ""
"Aftalen om Redis-aktivering blev ændret før godkendelse. Opdater Opsætning, "
"og gennemgå den aktuelle aftale."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The Redis activation contract is not ready."
msgstr "Aftalen om Redis-aktivering er ikke klar."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-operation-contract.php
msgid ""
"The Redis target remains isolated, WordPress has no competing object-cache "
"runtime and current acceptance is clean. The exact contract can now be "
"passed to the explicit R3 activation, verification and rollback workflow."
msgstr ""
"Redis-destinationen er fortsat isoleret, WordPress har ingen konkurrerende "
"objektcache, og den aktuelle godkendelse er bestået. Den præcise aftale kan "
"nu sendes til det eksplicitte R3-forløb for aktivering, verifikation og "
"tilbagerulning."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The W3 Total Cache Cloudflare extension is active."
msgstr "W3 Total Caches Cloudflare-udvidelse er aktiv."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The W3 Total Cache advanced-cache.php could not be read for rollback capture."
msgstr ""
"W3 Total Caches advanced-cache.php kunne ikke læses for at gemme en "
"tilbagerulningskopi."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The W3 Total Cache advanced-cache.php could not be removed with verified "
"read-back."
msgstr ""
"W3 Total Caches advanced-cache.php kunne ikke fjernes med verificeret "
"tilbagelæsning."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The W3 Total Cache plugin is inactive, but advanced-cache.php still requires"
" the protected final cleanup shown in Step 5 above."
msgstr ""
"W3 Total Cache-pluginet er inaktivt, men advanced-cache.php kræver stadig "
"den beskyttede endelige oprydning i trin 5 ovenfor."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid ""
"The W3TC Cloudflare extension is retired. Cloudflare DNS/proxy and saved "
"Cloudflare settings were not changed."
msgstr ""
"W3TC Cloudflare-udvidelsen er udfaset. Cloudflare DNS/proxy og gemte "
"Cloudflare-indstillinger blev ikke ændret."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The WordPress content directory is unavailable for legacy drop-in rollback."
msgstr ""
"WordPress' indholdsmappe er utilgængelig til tilbagerulning af det tidligere"
" drop-in."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The WordPress content directory is unavailable for verified cleanup."
msgstr "WordPress' indholdsmappe er utilgængelig til verificeret oprydning."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid "The YPerf Page Cache is no longer active, so stability sampling stopped."
msgstr "YPerf-sidecachen er ikke længere aktiv, så stabilitetsmålingen blev stoppet."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The YPerf advanced-cache.php hash changed after activation. Automatic "
"removal is blocked for review."
msgstr ""
"Hashværdien for YPerfs advanced-cache.php blev ændret efter aktivering. "
"Automatisk fjernelse er blokeret til gennemgang."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid "The YPerf advanced-cache.php template is unavailable."
msgstr "Skabelonen til YPerfs advanced-cache.php er utilgængelig."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The YPerf control operation failed."
msgstr "YPerfs kontroloperation mislykkedes."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The YPerf object-cache drop-in changed after activation. Automatic removal "
"is blocked until ownership is reviewed."
msgstr ""
"YPerfs objektcache-drop-in blev ændret efter aktivering. Automatisk "
"fjernelse er blokeret, indtil ejerskabet er gennemgået."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The YPerf object-cache drop-in template is unavailable."
msgstr "Skabelonen til YPerfs objektcache-drop-in er utilgængelig."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid "The YPerf page-cache drop-in template could not be rendered safely."
msgstr "Skabelonen til YPerfs sidecache-drop-in kunne ikke genereres sikkert."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"The YPerf-owned portable Page Cache already owns page-cache execution. "
"Native Nginx adoption stays locked so the site never runs two competing "
"page-cache authorities."
msgstr ""
"Den flytbare sidecache, som YPerf administrerer, står allerede for "
"sidecachens udførelse. Overtagelse af indbygget Nginx forbliver låst, så "
"webstedet aldrig har to konkurrerende sidecacheadministratorer."

msgid "The YPerf-owned replacement must pass before migration can finalize."
msgstr ""
"Den erstatning, som YPerf administrerer, skal bestå kontrollen, før "
"migreringen kan afsluttes."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The Yablonsky AI API key could not be saved. Check the key and server "
"cryptography support."
msgstr ""
"Yablonsky AI API-nøglen kunne ikke gemmes. Kontrollér nøglen og serverens "
"understøttelse af kryptografi."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The account API key authenticates optional Yablonsky AI remote compute. It "
"is not a plugin license and never unlocks local YPerf functionality. "
"External requests happen only after an explicit administrator action."
msgstr ""
"Kontoens API-nøgle godkender valgfri ekstern beregning hos Yablonsky AI. Den"
" er ikke en pluginlicens og låser aldrig op for lokal YPerf-funktionalitet. "
"Eksterne anmodninger sker kun efter en eksplicit administratorhandling."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid ""
"The adopted cache zone is used by more than one Nginx server block. YPerf "
"will not prepare a zone-wide purge path that could affect another site."
msgstr ""
"Den overtagne cachezone bruges af mere end én Nginx-serverblok. YPerf "
"forbereder ikke rydning af hele zonen, da det kan påvirke et andet websted."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The audit is ready and will keep the 50 most recent semantic invalidation "
"requests."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollen er klar og bevarer de 50 seneste anmodninger om semantisk "
"ugyldiggørelse."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The baseline was rolled back after proof detected a failure or confirmed "
"regression."
msgstr ""
"Basisstatus blev rullet tilbage, efter at verifikationen registrerede en "
"fejl eller en bekræftet regression."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The bundled Host Inspector file is missing or unreadable."
msgstr "Den medfølgende værtsinspektørfil mangler eller kan ikke læses."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid "The cache zone is visible, but its server-block ownership is not proven yet."
msgstr ""
"Cachezonen er synlig, men det er endnu ikke verificeret, hvilken serverblok "
"der ejer den."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The campaign changes only the YPerf-owned portable Page Cache boundary."
msgstr ""
"Forløbet ændrer kun grænsen for den flytbare sidecache, som YPerf "
"administrerer."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The contract preserves an explicit admin worker reserve and records the "
"exact before-state. R3 can adopt an already-safe native max_children limit "
"without rewriting PHP-FPM; any future host rewrite still requires syntax "
"test, read-back, Runtime Acceptance and rollback."
msgstr ""
"Aftalen bevarer en eksplicit reserve af administratorarbejdsprocesser og "
"registrerer den præcise tidligere tilstand. R3 kan overtage en allerede "
"sikker indbygget max_children-grænse uden at omskrive PHP-FPM; enhver "
"fremtidig værtsændring kræver stadig syntakstest, tilbagelæsning, "
"driftsgodkendelse og tilbagerulning."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"The current Redis eviction policy is not an allkeys LRU/LFU policy. Adoption"
" remains blocked pending explicit review."
msgstr ""
"Den aktuelle Redis-politik for udsmidning af data er ikke en allkeys LRU"
"/LFU-politik. Overtagelse forbliver blokeret, indtil en eksplicit gennemgang"
" er udført."

#: includes/class-yperf-control-plane-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The current YPerf Runtime Acceptance is missing, stale or contains a "
"functional failure. Control-plane capacity is not considered releasable "
"until the site baseline is clean."
msgstr ""
"Den aktuelle YPerf-driftsgodkendelse mangler, er forældet eller indeholder "
"en funktionel fejl. Kontrolplanets kapacitet kan ikke frigives, før "
"webstedets basisstatus er i orden."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The current YPerf early runtime must pass before Video Lite can be changed."
msgstr ""
"YPerfs aktuelle tidlige driftsmiljø skal bestå kontrollen, før Video Lite "
"kan ændres."

msgid ""
"The current YPerf early runtime must pass before media optimization can be "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"YPerfs aktuelle tidlige driftsmiljø skal bestå kontrollen, før "
"medieoptimering kan ændres."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The current YPerf version has clean read-only proof."
msgstr "Den aktuelle YPerf-version har bestået den skrivebeskyttede kontrol."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The current advanced-cache.php ownership or hash is ambiguous. Artifact "
"refresh is blocked for review."
msgstr ""
"Ejerskabet eller hashværdien for den aktuelle advanced-cache.php er uklar. "
"Opdatering af komponenten er blokeret til gennemgang."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"The current origin probe proves BYPASS rather than HIT, so there is nothing "
"safe to adopt as an active page-cache executor yet."
msgstr ""
"Den aktuelle prøve på oprindelsesserveren verificerer BYPASS frem for HIT, "
"så der er endnu ingen aktiv sidecachemekanisme, som sikkert kan overtages."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The deeper check only adds localhost service reachability and optional "
"capability confirmation; it is not an installation step."
msgstr ""
"Den dybere kontrol tilføjer kun adgang til lokale tjenester og valgfri "
"bekræftelse af funktioner; det er ikke et installationstrin."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"The delivery engine is route-aware, skips cart/checkout/account and logged-"
"in traffic, preserves theme/jQuery execution, and is covered by Runtime "
"Acceptance plus automatic rollback."
msgstr ""
"Leveringsmotoren tager højde for ruter, springer kurv/kasse/konto og "
"indlogget trafik over, bevarer tema- og jQuery-udførelse og er dækket af "
"driftsgodkendelse samt automatisk tilbagerulning."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The exact W3 Total Cache advanced-cache.php is captured locally for rollback"
" before any file change."
msgstr ""
"Den præcise W3 Total Cache advanced-cache.php gemmes lokalt til "
"tilbagerulning før enhver filændring."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid "The existing W3 Total Cache drop-in could not be backed up for rollback."
msgstr ""
"Det eksisterende W3 Total Cache-drop-in kunne ikke sikkerhedskopieres til "
"tilbagerulning."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid "The existing WP_CACHE=false declaration could not be changed safely."
msgstr "Den eksisterende erklæring WP_CACHE=false kunne ikke ændres sikkert."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid "The existing YPerf Page Cache artifact could not be read for rollback."
msgstr ""
"Den eksisterende YPerf-sidecachekomponent kunne ikke læses til "
"tilbagerulning."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The existing YPerf Page Cache artifact is not in the reviewed compatibility "
"chain. Refresh is blocked."
msgstr ""
"Den eksisterende YPerf-sidecachekomponent indgår ikke i den gennemgåede "
"kompatibilitetskæde. Opdatering er blokeret."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-adoption.php
msgid ""
"The existing site pool already has a bounded worker limit and current "
"acceptance is clean. YPerf can adopt that native limit without changing PHP-"
"FPM."
msgstr ""
"Den eksisterende webstedspulje har allerede en begrænset grænse for "
"arbejdsprocesser, og den aktuelle godkendelse er bestået. YPerf kan overtage"
" den indbyggede grænse uden at ændre PHP-FPM."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The frozen Redis database or key namespace is invalid."
msgstr "Den fastlåste Redis-database eller nøglenavnerummet er ugyldigt."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The handover button unlocks automatically after Step 4 proves that all "
"active provider responsibilities have a safe path."
msgstr ""
"Overdragelsesknappen åbnes automatisk, efter at trin 4 har verificeret, at "
"alle aktive udbyderansvarsområder har en sikker vej."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The helper is bundled with this exact YPerf release. It does not install "
"packages, edit configuration, restart services, scan Redis keys or export "
"raw server configuration."
msgstr ""
"Værktøjet følger med præcis denne YPerf-udgivelse. Det installerer ikke "
"pakker, redigerer konfiguration, genstarter tjenester, scanner Redis-nøgler "
"eller eksporterer rå serverkonfiguration."

#: includes/class-yperf-settings-transfer.php
msgid "The imported configuration failed the final Health Check."
msgstr "Den importerede konfiguration bestod ikke den endelige tilstandskontrol."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The installed YPerf Page Cache artifact is not in the reviewed compatibility"
" chain."
msgstr ""
"Den installerede YPerf-sidecachekomponent indgår ikke i den gennemgåede "
"kompatibilitetskæde."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The legacy advanced-cache.php is unexpectedly large, so YPerf refused "
"automatic cleanup."
msgstr ""
"Den tidligere advanced-cache.php er uventet stor, så YPerf afviste "
"automatisk oprydning."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The legacy advanced-cache.php no longer has high-confidence W3 Total Cache "
"ownership."
msgstr ""
"Ejerskabet af den tidligere advanced-cache.php kan ikke længere med stor "
"sikkerhed tilskrives W3 Total Cache."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The legacy drop-in could not be captured safely, so nothing was removed."
msgstr "Det tidligere drop-in kunne ikke gemmes sikkert, så intet blev fjernet."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The legacy provider is inactive, its owned advanced-cache.php is retired, "
"and post-cleanup Runtime Acceptance is clean."
msgstr ""
"Den tidligere udbyder er inaktiv, dens advanced-cache.php er udfaset, og "
"driftsgodkendelsen efter oprydning er bestået."

msgid ""
"The live YPerf Page Cache hash differs from the stored authority record. "
"Repair is blocked for review."
msgstr ""
"Den aktuelle hashværdi for YPerf-sidecachen afviger fra den gemte "
"ansvarsregistrering. Reparation er blokeret til gennemgang."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The loaded YPerf drop-in did not prove its own Redis connection, database "
"and namespace."
msgstr ""
"Det indlæste YPerf-drop-in kunne ikke verificere sin egen Redis-forbindelse,"
" database og sit navnerum."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The loaded object-cache drop-in does not match the approved artifact hash."
msgstr ""
"Det indlæste objektcache-drop-in svarer ikke til den godkendte hashværdi for"
" komponenten."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The local YPerf profile is proven, but no page-cache executor is active yet."
" Run the bounded Page Cache stability campaign to prove MISS → HIT, Runtime "
"safety and repeat-HIT consistency before moving deeper into Redis or Origin "
"tuning."
msgstr ""
"Den lokale YPerf-profil er verificeret, men ingen sidecachemekanisme er "
"aktiv endnu. Kør det begrænsede stabilitetsforløb for sidecache for at "
"verificere MISS → HIT, driftssikkerhed og ensartethed ved gentagne HIT, før "
"du går videre med Redis- eller Origin-justering."

#: includes/class-yperf-ai-advisor.php
msgid ""
"The local YPerf safety gate lowered the AI profile because current "
"deterministic evidence does not authorize the requested level."
msgstr ""
"YPerfs lokale sikkerhedskontrol sænkede AI-profilen, fordi den aktuelle "
"regelbaserede dokumentation ikke tillader det ønskede niveau."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The local profile was applied and accepted by Runtime Acceptance."
msgstr "Den lokale profil blev anvendt og godkendt af driftsgodkendelsen."

#: includes/class-yperf-release-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The local runtime/control-plane gates are healthy. Official WordPress Plugin"
" Check remains an external human acceptance gate and is never fabricated "
"from inside YPerf."
msgstr ""
"De lokale kontroller for driftsmiljø og kontrolplan er i orden. Officiel "
"WordPress Plugin Check forbliver en ekstern kontrol, der skal godkendes af "
"et menneske, og den må aldrig forfalskes inde fra YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"The log is local, bounded and intended for debugging invalidation storms and"
" unexpected cache churn."
msgstr ""
"Loggen er lokal, begrænset og beregnet til fejlfinding af "
"ugyldiggørelsesstorme og uventet cacheaktivitet."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The model catalog comes from the verified account plan; YPerf does not ship "
"a frozen provider list."
msgstr ""
"Modelkataloget kommer fra den verificerede kontoplan; YPerf leverer ikke en "
"fastfrosset udbyderliste."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The model requested a broader profile than current deterministic evidence "
"allows. YPerf lowered it before any Apply became possible."
msgstr ""
"Modellen anmodede om en bredere profil end den aktuelle regelbaserede "
"dokumentation tillader. YPerf sænkede niveauet, før Anvend blev muligt."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid ""
"The native executor is adopted, but current-version Runtime Acceptance must "
"be clean before an operation plan can advance."
msgstr ""
"Den indbyggede mekanisme er overtaget, men driftsgodkendelsen for den "
"aktuelle version skal være bestået, før en operationsplan kan fortsætte."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"The native proof belongs to a different hostname, so YPerf will not adopt it"
" for this site."
msgstr ""
"Den indbyggede verifikation tilhører et andet værtsnavn, så YPerf overtager "
"den ikke for dette websted."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The new YPerf-owned runtime must pass before migration can finalize."
msgstr ""
"Det nye driftsmiljø, som YPerf administrerer, skal bestå kontrollen, før "
"migreringen kan afsluttes."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The next Runtime Acceptance will capture query count, database time, slow-"
"query counts and query families for origin-executed frontend probes."
msgstr ""
"Næste driftsgodkendelse registrerer antal forespørgsler, databasetid, antal "
"langsomme forespørgsler og forespørgselsfamilier for frontend-prøver, der "
"udføres på oprindelsesserveren."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The object-cache drop-in template could not be rendered safely."
msgstr "Skabelonen til objektcache-drop-in kunne ikke genereres sikkert."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The old provider is deactivated only inside a transaction. YPerf then "
"reconciles ownership, proves execution, runs Runtime Acceptance, and "
"restores the previous provider automatically if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"Den tidligere udbyder deaktiveres kun som led i en transaktion. YPerf "
"afstemmer derefter ejerskab, verificerer udførelse, kører driftsgodkendelse "
"og gendanner automatisk den tidligere udbyder, hvis verifikationen "
"mislykkes."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The origin probe currently proves BYPASS, so YPerf will not claim page "
"acceleration."
msgstr ""
"Prøven på oprindelsesserveren verificerer i øjeblikket BYPASS, så YPerf "
"hævder ikke, at sider accelereres."

#: assets/admin.js
msgid "The original operation may still be running. Do not start it again."
msgstr "Den oprindelige operation kører muligvis stadig. Start den ikke igen."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"The portable MU layer provides local origin protection on standard WordPress"
" hosting. Native server and edge adapters can extend protection earlier in "
"the request path."
msgstr ""
"Det flytbare MU-lag giver lokal beskyttelse af oprindelsesserveren på "
"almindelig WordPress-hosting. Indbyggede server- og edge-adaptere kan udvide"
" beskyttelsen tidligere i anmodningens forløb."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The post-apply request set is checking public routes and safety policies."
msgstr ""
"Anmodningerne efter anvendelse kontrollerer offentlige ruter og "
"sikkerhedspolitikker."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid ""
"The pre-migration W3 Total Cache responsibility settings could not be "
"restored automatically."
msgstr ""
"Indstillingerne for W3 Total Caches ansvarsområder før migrering kunne ikke "
"gendannes automatisk."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The previous YPerf profile is restored and the rollback Runtime Acceptance "
"completed."
msgstr ""
"Den tidligere YPerf-profil er gendannet, og driftsgodkendelsen efter "
