msgstr ""
"Den reserverede Redis-database kunne ikke verificeres igen umiddelbart før "
"aktivering."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The reserved Redis database is no longer empty. YPerf stopped before writing"
" object-cache.php; release the reservation and refresh Host Intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Den reserverede Redis-database er ikke længere tom. YPerf stoppede før "
"skrivning af object-cache.php; frigiv reservationen, og opdater "
"Værtsindsigt."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The reserved Redis target failed its bounded write/read/delete proof."
msgstr ""
"Den reserverede Redis-destination bestod ikke den begrænsede "
"skrive-/læse-/slettekontrol."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-operation-contract.php
msgid ""
"The reserved logical database is no longer the empty database proven by "
"current host evidence. Release the reservation and re-evaluate instead of "
"reusing stale isolation evidence."
msgstr ""
"Den reserverede logiske database er ikke længere den tomme database, som den"
" aktuelle værtsdokumentation verificerede. Frigiv reservationen, og vurder "
"på ny i stedet for at genbruge forældet dokumentation for isolering."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The restored advanced-cache.php did not match the saved rollback fingerprint."
msgstr ""
"Den gendannede advanced-cache.php svarede ikke til den gemte hashværdi for "
"tilbagerulning."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "The reviewed Yablonsky AI User API contract is not available."
msgstr "Den gennemgåede Yablonsky AI User API-aftale er ikke tilgængelig."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "The reviewed Yablonsky AI authentication contract is incomplete."
msgstr "Den gennemgåede Yablonsky AI-godkendelsesaftale er ufuldstændig."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "The reviewed Yablonsky AI compute contract is incomplete."
msgstr "Den gennemgåede Yablonsky AI-beregningsaftale er ufuldstændig."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The reviewed Yablonsky AI contract needs attention."
msgstr "Den gennemgåede Yablonsky AI-aftale kræver opmærksomhed."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The saved W3 Total Cache advanced-cache.php could not be restored."
msgstr "Den gemte W3 Total Cache advanced-cache.php kunne ikke gendannes."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "The saved Yablonsky AI credential could not be read. Save the key again."
msgstr "De gemte Yablonsky AI-loginoplysninger kunne ikke læses. Gem nøglen igen."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The saved legacy drop-in backup failed integrity verification."
msgstr ""
"Den gemte sikkerhedskopi af det tidligere drop-in bestod ikke "
"integritetskontrollen."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The selected AI model is not available to this verified workspace. Refresh "
"the account catalog and choose again."
msgstr ""
"Den valgte AI-model er ikke tilgængelig i dette verificerede arbejdsområde. "
"Opdater kontokataloget, og vælg igen."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The selected YPerf baseline was applied and accepted by Runtime Acceptance."
msgstr ""
"De valgte YPerf-basisindstillinger blev anvendt og godkendt af "
"driftsgodkendelsen."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The selected YPerf baseline was applied, accepted by Runtime Acceptance and "
"automatically prewarmed."
msgstr ""
"De valgte YPerf-basisindstillinger blev anvendt, godkendt af "
"driftsgodkendelsen og automatisk forvarmet."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid ""
"The selected Yablonsky AI text model is not available to this verified "
"workspace."
msgstr ""
"Den valgte Yablonsky AI-tekstmodel er ikke tilgængelig i dette verificerede "
"arbejdsområde."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The selected local profile can now be applied inside the YPerf-owned "
"WordPress boundary."
msgstr ""
"Den valgte lokale profil kan nu anvendes inden for YPerfs administrative "
"WordPress-grænse."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The selected settings backup is not valid JSON."
msgstr "Den valgte sikkerhedskopi af indstillinger er ikke gyldig JSON."

msgid ""
"The setting changes WordPress origin delivery only. Existing external "
"Nginx/Cloudflare HTML cache entries require independent freshness "
"verification; YPerf does not silently purge host caches."
msgstr ""
"Indstillingen ændrer kun levering fra WordPress-oprindelsesserveren. "
"Eksisterende HTML-cacheposter i ekstern Nginx/Cloudflare kræver uafhængig "
"verifikation af aktualitet; YPerf rydder ikke værtscacher uden samtykke."

#: includes/class-yperf-settings-transfer.php
msgid "The settings backup does not contain any portable YPerf settings."
msgstr "Sikkerhedskopien indeholder ingen flytbare YPerf-indstillinger."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The settings backup is larger than the supported 256 KB safety limit."
msgstr ""
"Sikkerhedskopien af indstillinger overskrider den understøttede "
"sikkerhedsgrænse på 256 KB."

#: includes/class-yperf-control-plane-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The site is functional, but current host/FPM headroom does not prove a "
"comfortable reserve for admin work during frontend pressure. Origin Budget "
"review should preserve an explicit control-plane reserve."
msgstr ""
"Webstedet fungerer, men den aktuelle værts-/FPM-reserve dokumenterer ikke en"
" tilstrækkelig reserve til administratorarbejde under belastning af "
"frontend. Gennemgang af Origin Budget bør bevare en eksplicit "
"kontrolplansreserve."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The site is mapped to a concrete PHP-FPM pool; origin-budget recommendations"
" can now be evidence-based."
msgstr ""
"Webstedet er knyttet til en konkret PHP-FPM-pulje; anbefalinger om Origin "
"Budget kan nu baseres på dokumentation."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The site pool is mapped, but no live worker RSS sample is available. Do not "
"derive an Origin Budget from configuration alone."
msgstr ""
"Webstedets pulje er kortlagt, men der findes ingen aktuelle RSS-prøver af "
"arbejdsprocesserne. Beregn ikke Origin Budget ud fra konfiguration alene."

msgid "The sitemap diagnostic stayed inside its bounded execution budget."
msgstr "Sitemapdiagnostikken holdt sig inden for den begrænsede udførelsestid."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The stability metric is local same-origin cache evidence, not a Google "
"PageSpeed score. Use repeated PageSpeed runs later as an external field "
"check after YPerf has proved deterministic cache execution."
msgstr ""
"Stabilitetsmålingen er lokal cache-dokumentation fra samme oprindelse, ikke "
"en Google PageSpeed-score. Brug senere gentagne PageSpeed-kørsler som "
"ekstern feltkontrol, når YPerf har verificeret regelbaseret cacheudførelse."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The staged object-cache drop-in failed its read-back hash check."
msgstr ""
"Det klargjorte objektcache-drop-in bestod ikke sin hashkontrol ved "
"tilbagelæsning."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The stored Page Cache artifact hash does not match the live file. Refresh is"
" blocked."
msgstr ""
"Den gemte hashværdi for sidecachekomponenten stemmer ikke med den aktuelle "
"fil. Opdatering er blokeret."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid ""
"The zone is exclusive to this server block. YPerf can operate prewarm now "
"while host writes remain locked."
msgstr ""
"Zonen tilhører kun denne serverblok. YPerf kan forvarme nu, mens skrivning "
"til værten forbliver låst."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Theme contrast, accessibility styling and third-party scripts such as chat "
"widgets remain outside this write boundary. YPerf may diagnose those costs "
"later, but this campaign does not rewrite external code just to improve a "
"benchmark score."
msgstr ""
"Temaets kontrast, tilgængelighedsstyling og tredjepartsscripts såsom "
"chatwidgets ligger uden for denne skrivegrænse. YPerf kan senere "
"diagnosticere belastningen fra dem, men dette forløb omskriver ikke ekstern "
"kode blot for at forbedre en benchmarkscore."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Think of it as PageSpeed Insights with access under the hood."
msgstr "Tænk på det som PageSpeed Insights med adgang til de interne detaljer."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "This YPerf capability is operated from its dedicated bounded workflow."
msgstr "Denne YPerf-funktion administreres fra sin egen begrænsede arbejdsgang."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This completed migration remains visible as history. Future YPerf updates do"
" not ask you to migrate the same provider again."
msgstr ""
"Denne afsluttede migrering forbliver synlig i historikken. Fremtidige YPerf-"
"opdateringer beder dig ikke om at migrere den samme udbyder igen."

#: includes/class-yperf-settings-transfer.php
msgid "This file is not a supported Yablonsky Performance settings backup."
msgstr ""
"Denne fil er ikke en understøttet sikkerhedskopi af Yablonsky Performance-"
"indstillinger."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This gate turns intermittent admin incidents into explicit release/tuning "
"evidence. It never raises PHP memory, changes FPM or alters the WordPress "
"upgrader automatically."
msgstr ""
"Denne kontrol gør periodiske administratorhændelser til eksplicit "
"dokumentation for udgivelse og justering. Den øger aldrig automatisk PHP-"
"hukommelsen, ændrer FPM eller WordPress-opgraderingen."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This indicator tracks site configuration and evidence — not YPerf "
"development progress."
msgstr ""
"Denne indikator følger webstedets konfiguration og dokumentation — ikke "
"udviklingsfremdriften for YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a PHP runtime capability, not something YPerf should imitate in "
"WordPress."
msgstr "Dette er en PHP-driftsfunktion, ikke noget YPerf bør efterligne i WordPress."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a core YPerf advantage: first-hit work is treated separately from "
"repeat-hit cache."
msgstr ""
"Dette er en central YPerf-fordel: Arbejdet ved første besøg håndteres "
"særskilt fra cachen ved gentagne besøg."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a local low-risk optimization layer; it is intentionally separate "
"from cache and server adoption."
msgstr ""
"Dette er et lokalt optimeringslag med lav risiko, bevidst adskilt fra "
"overtagelse af cache og server."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is separate from Site Readiness. It tracks whether the detected legacy "
"provider can be retired without losing an active responsibility."
msgstr ""
"Dette er adskilt fra Webstedet er klar. Det registrerer, om en tidligere "
"udbyder kan udfases uden at miste et aktivt ansvarsområde."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is the answer to “what is actually working?”. Detection alone never "
"gets a green ACTIVE state."
msgstr ""
"Dette besvarer spørgsmålet »hvad fungerer faktisk?«. Registrering alene "
"giver aldrig en grøn AKTIV-status."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is the first explicit local write boundary: YPerf may create only its "
"own wp-content/object-cache.php and namespaced Redis health/cache keys in "
"the reserved logical database."
msgstr ""
"Dette er den første eksplicitte lokale skrivegrænse: YPerf må kun oprette "
"sin egen wp-content/object-cache.php og navnerumsafgrænsede Redis-nøgler til"
" tilstand og cache i den reserverede logiske database."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid "This provider responsibility is not supported by the guided resolver."
msgstr "Dette udbyderansvar understøttes ikke af den guidede afklaring."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This refresh is read-only: it rechecks the environment, runs Runtime "
"Acceptance and rebuilds the performance benchmark. It does not enable cache,"
" alter providers or change host configuration."
msgstr ""
"Denne opdatering er skrivebeskyttet: Den kontrollerer miljøet igen, kører "
"driftsgodkendelse og genopbygger ydelsesbenchmarket. Den aktiverer ikke "
"cache, ændrer ikke udbydere og ændrer ikke værtskonfigurationen."

#: includes/class-yperf-recommendations.php
msgid ""
"This site has enough published content for publishing workflow automation to"
" become relevant. A future Yablonsky Publisher integration can use YPerf "
"performance evidence without turning the cache dashboard into an advertising"
" surface."
msgstr ""
"Dette websted har nok udgivet indhold til, at automatisering af "
"udgivelsesarbejdsgange kan være relevant. En fremtidig integration med "
"Yablonsky Publisher kan bruge YPerfs ydelsesdokumentation uden at gøre "
"cachepanelet til en reklameflade."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This site-level view tracks optional Redis/native-host execution lanes and "
"provider-retirement evidence. It is informative and does not make optional "
"host features a market-release requirement."
msgstr ""
"Denne webstedsvisning følger valgfrie udførelsesveje for Redis/indbygget "
"vært og dokumentation for udfasning af udbydere. Den er informativ og gør "
"ikke valgfrie værtsfunktioner til et udgivelseskrav."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This snapshot proves only part of the native stack. Run the Host Inspector "
"bundled with the current YPerf release to capture site-specific Nginx "
"ownership, Redis isolation/headroom and exact PHP-FPM worker-memory "
"evidence."
msgstr ""
"Dette øjebliksbillede verificerer kun en del af den indbyggede stak. Kør "
"værtsinspektøren, der følger med den aktuelle YPerf-udgivelse, for at "
"registrere webstedsspecifikt Nginx-ejerskab, Redis-isolering/reserve og "
"præcise målinger af PHP-FPM-arbejdsprocessers hukommelse."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This tile is evidence only. YPerf does not claim ownership of an external "
"runtime layer."
msgstr ""
"Dette felt er kun dokumentation. YPerf hævder ikke ejerskab af et eksternt "
"driftslag."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Three frontend samples per route plus isolated Redis/Memcached localhost "
"read tests. No cache setting is changed."
msgstr ""
"Tre frontend-prøver pr. rute samt isolerede læsetests af Redis/Memcached på "
"localhost. Ingen cacheindstillinger ændres."

