msgstr ""
"YPerf-sidecachen kunne ikke verificere MISS → HIT. En gennemgang er påkrævet"
" før yderligere cacheændringer."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"YPerf Page Cache did not prove MISS → HIT. The new activation was rolled "
"back automatically."
msgstr ""
"YPerf-sidecachen kunne ikke verificere MISS → HIT. Den nye aktivering blev "
"automatisk rullet tilbage."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid "YPerf Page Cache drop-in activated."
msgstr "Drop-in til YPerf-sidecache aktiveret."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf Page Cache must be enabled before its executor artifact can be "
"refreshed."
msgstr "YPerf-sidecache skal aktiveres, før dens komponent kan opdateres."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf Redis Object Cache is active and isolated for this site."
msgstr "YPerf Redis-objektcache er aktiv og isoleret for dette websted."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf automatically configures only its own WordPress cache and optimization"
" controls. Nginx, Redis, PHP-FPM, OS packages and third-party providers stay"
" untouched unless you explicitly use an expert workflow."
msgstr ""
"YPerf konfigurerer automatisk kun sine egne WordPress-cache- og "
"optimeringskontroller. Nginx, Redis, PHP-FPM, OS-pakker og "
"tredjepartsudbydere forbliver urørte, medmindre du eksplicit bruger en "
"ekspertarbejdsgang."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf can still detect generic cache artifacts; exact migration adapters "
"will appear here when a supported provider is present."
msgstr ""
"YPerf kan stadig registrere generiske cachekomponenter; adaptere til præcis "
"migrering vises her, når en understøttet udbyder er til stede."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf cannot safely finalize the remaining advanced-cache.php because "
"ownership is not proven."
msgstr ""
"YPerf kan ikke sikkert afslutte den resterende advanced-cache.php, fordi "
"ejerskabet ikke er verificeret."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf changes browser HTML caching only when its own Page Cache is active "
"and the request policy classifies the request as public/cacheable."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ændrer kun browsercaching af HTML, når dens egen sidecache er aktiv, "
"og anmodningspolitikken klassificerer anmodningen som offentlig og "
"cacheegnet."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf changes only controls it owns inside WordPress. Existing Nginx, Redis,"
" PHP-FPM and provider configuration remains untouched until a separate "
"reviewed adoption path exists."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ændrer kun kontroller, som pluginet selv styrer i WordPress. "
"Eksisterende Nginx-, Redis-, PHP-FPM- og udbyderkonfigurationer forbliver "
"urørte, indtil en separat, gennemgået overtagelsesvej findes."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf control"
msgstr "YPerf-kontrol"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf control changed and Runtime Acceptance accepted the result."
msgstr "YPerf-kontrollen blev ændret, og driftsgodkendelsen accepterede resultatet."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
#, php-format
msgid ""
"YPerf controls enabled: %1$d · proven by Runtime Acceptance: %2$d · active "
"acceleration layers on this site: %3$d."
msgstr ""
"Aktiverede YPerf-kontroller: %1$d · verificeret af driftsgodkendelse: %2$d ·"
" aktive accelerationslag på dette websted: %3$d."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid "YPerf could not atomically install advanced-cache.php."
msgstr "YPerf kunne ikke installere advanced-cache.php atomisk."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "YPerf could not atomically place wp-content/object-cache.php."
msgstr "YPerf kunne ikke placere wp-content/object-cache.php atomisk."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid "YPerf could not atomically refresh advanced-cache.php."
msgstr "YPerf kunne ikke opdatere advanced-cache.php atomisk."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid "YPerf could not prepare its bounded page-cache directory."
msgstr "YPerf kunne ikke forberede sin afgrænsede sidecachemappe."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid "YPerf could not remove its advanced-cache.php drop-in."
msgstr "YPerf kunne ikke fjerne sin advanced-cache.php-drop-in."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "YPerf could not remove its object-cache drop-in."
msgstr "YPerf kunne ikke fjerne sin objektcache-drop-in."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "YPerf could not restore the previous page-cache drop-in safely."
msgstr "YPerf kunne ikke sikkert gendanne den tidligere sidecache-drop-in."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "YPerf could not restore the saved W3 Total Cache advanced-cache.php safely."
msgstr ""
"YPerf kunne ikke sikkert gendanne den gemte W3 Total Cache advanced-"
"cache.php."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf could not safely activate the cache baseline."
msgstr "YPerf kunne ikke sikkert aktivere cache-basisindstillingerne."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid "YPerf could not safely enable WP_CACHE."
msgstr "YPerf kunne ikke sikkert aktivere WP_CACHE."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "YPerf could not stage the object-cache drop-in."
msgstr "YPerf kunne ikke klargøre objektcache-drop-in-filen."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf could not verify Page Cache first, so Browser Cache was not enabled."
msgstr ""
"YPerf kunne ikke først verificere sidecache, så browsercache blev ikke "
"aktiveret."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf dashboard sections"
msgstr "Afsnit på YPerf-kontrolpanelet"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf deliberately cannot mark its own Plugin Check green. The official "
"checker stays an independent human acceptance signal."
msgstr ""
"YPerf kan bevidst ikke markere sin egen Plugin Check som grøn. Den "
"officielle kontrol forbliver et uafhængigt signal, som skal godkendes af et "
"menneske."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf does not build a second cache. The adoption stage recognizes a fresh, "
"proven site-specific Nginx cache as the authoritative page-cache executor "
"without editing Nginx or restarting any service."
msgstr ""
"YPerf opretter ikke en ekstra cache. Overtagelsestrinnet genkender en ny, "
"verificeret, webstedsspecifik Nginx-cache som primær sidecachemekanisme uden"
" at redigere Nginx eller genstarte tjenester."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf does not change pm.max_children, pm.max_requests or reload PHP-FPM in "
"this release."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ændrer ikke pm.max_children, pm.max_requests eller genindlæser PHP-FPM"
" i denne version."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid "YPerf does not yet recognize this web-server family."
msgstr "YPerf genkender endnu ikke denne webserverfamilie."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf enables this only when Redis isolation and memory headroom are safe. "
"It is never forced just to increase a feature count."
msgstr ""
"YPerf aktiverer kun dette, når Redis-isolering og hukommelsesreserve er "
"sikre. Funktionen tvinges aldrig til blot for at øge antallet af funktioner."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf first captures a fresh read-only baseline, then applies the selected "
"local profile and immediately repeats Runtime Acceptance. A preflight FAIL "
"makes no changes; a post-apply FAIL restores the previous profile "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"YPerf gemmer først en ny skrivebeskyttet basisstatus, anvender derefter den "
"valgte lokale profil og gentager straks driftsgodkendelsen. En fejl ved "
"indledende kontrol medfører ingen ændringer; en fejl efter anvendelse "
"gendanner automatisk den tidligere profil."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has a current local reservation for the isolated Redis target. No "
"Redis key, drop-in or server configuration has been created."
msgstr ""
"YPerf har en aktuel lokal reservation af den isolerede Redis-destination. "
"Ingen Redis-nøgle, drop-in-fil eller serverkonfiguration er oprettet."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has adopted the existing PHP-FPM max_children limit as the site Origin"
" Budget. No host file was rewritten because the current native limit already"
" enforces the reviewed boundary."
msgstr ""
"YPerf har overtaget den eksisterende PHP-FPM max_children-grænse som "
"webstedets Origin Budget. Ingen værtsfiler blev omskrevet, fordi den "
"aktuelle indbyggede grænse allerede håndhæver den gennemgåede begrænsning."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-readiness.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has an exact site pool, live worker-memory evidence and current "
"Runtime Acceptance. This is enough to review a bounded Origin Budget, but "
"not enough to change FPM automatically."
msgstr ""
"YPerf har en præcis webstedspulje, aktuelle oplysninger om "
"arbejdsprocessernes hukommelse og aktuel driftsgodkendelse. Det er "
"tilstrækkeligt til at gennemgå et begrænset Origin Budget, men ikke til "
"automatisk at ændre FPM."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-contract.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has exact pool identity, live worker memory evidence and a control-"
"plane reserve model. R2 freezes the reviewed before-state and rollback "
"authority without editing PHP-FPM."
msgstr ""
"YPerf har præcis puljeidentitet, aktuelle oplysninger om arbejdsprocessernes"
" hukommelse og en model for kontrolplanets reserve. R2 fastlåser den "
"gennemgåede tidligere tilstand og retten til tilbagerulning uden at redigere"
" PHP-FPM."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf is already active"
msgstr "YPerf er allerede aktiv"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is applying only allowlisted performance settings, then proving them "
"by read-back."
msgstr ""
"YPerf anvender kun tilladte ydelsesindstillinger og verificerer dem derefter"
" ved tilbagelæsning."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is preserving the browser-cache responsibility when it was active at "
"the source."
msgstr "YPerf bevarer ansvaret for browsercache, når den var aktiv hos kilden."

msgid "YPerf is preserving the prepared browser-cache responsibility."
msgstr "YPerf bevarer det forberedte ansvar for browsercache."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is purging the homepage URL through its cache authority and the "
"adopted Cloudflare purge bridge."
msgstr ""
"YPerf rydder startsidens URL gennem sin cacheadministrator og den overtagne "
"Cloudflare-bro til rydning."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is restoring only settings it previously changed and will not "
"overwrite unrelated external drift."
msgstr ""
"YPerf gendanner kun indstillinger, programmet tidligere har ændret, og "
"overskriver ikke uvedkommende eksterne ændringer."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is warming a bounded set of high-value public URLs so the first "
"visitor does not pay the cold-cache cost."
msgstr ""
"YPerf opvarmer et begrænset udvalg af vigtige offentlige URL'er, så den "
"første besøgende undgår omkostningen ved kold cache."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid ""
"YPerf keeps this option visible so the user can install or ask the host for "
"it later."
msgstr ""
"YPerf holder denne mulighed synlig, så brugeren senere kan installere den "
"eller bede værten om den."

msgid ""
"YPerf made no plugin activation changes. Review the page-cache ownership "
"state before retrying."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ændrede ikke nogen plugins aktiveringsstatus. Gennemgå ejerskabet af "
"sidecachen, før du prøver igen."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf may change"
msgstr "YPerf må ændre"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf may execute only the dedicated local operations whose exact contracts "
"are shown above. Host configuration writes still require a separately "
"reviewed helper with backup, exact diff, syntax test, read-back, acceptance "
"and rollback."
msgstr ""
"YPerf må kun udføre de særlige lokale operationer, hvis præcise aftaler "
"vises ovenfor. Skrivninger til værtskonfiguration kræver stadig et særskilt "
"gennemgået værktøj med sikkerhedskopi, præcis ændringsoversigt, syntakstest,"
" tilbagelæsning, godkendelse og tilbagerulning."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf needs current read-only Redis evidence. It can use a current Host "
"Inspector snapshot or inspect a local PhpRedis service directly without "
"writing keys or changing Redis configuration."
msgstr ""
"YPerf kræver aktuelle skrivebeskyttede Redis-oplysninger. De kan komme fra "
"et aktuelt øjebliksbillede af Værtsinspektør eller fra en direkte "
"undersøgelse af en lokal PhpRedis-tjeneste uden at skrive nøgler eller ændre"
" Redis-konfiguration."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf never changes"
msgstr "YPerf ændrer aldrig"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf object-cache drop-in was removed. Redis was not flushed or "
"reconfigured."
msgstr ""
"YPerfs objektcache-drop-in blev fjernet. Redis blev hverken tømt eller "
"omkonfigureret."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf owns only Rocket Loader OFF, HTTP/3 ON and purge synchronization."
msgstr ""
"YPerf administrerer kun Rocket Loader FRA, HTTP/3 TIL og synkronisering af "
"cacherydning."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the migrated layers and the post-handover Runtime Acceptance is "
"clean."
msgstr ""
"YPerf administrerer de migrerede lag, og driftsgodkendelsen efter "
"overdragelse er bestået."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the migrated responsibilities and post-handover Runtime "
"Acceptance is clean."
msgstr ""
"YPerf administrerer de migrerede ansvarsområder, og driftsgodkendelsen efter"
" overdragelse er bestået."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the portable WordPress page-cache executor, cacheability policy, "
"selective purge, prewarm, execution proof and rollback. Native server cache "
"remains a separate adoption path."
msgstr ""
"YPerf administrerer den flytbare WordPress-sidecachemekanisme, politik for "
"cacheegnethed, selektiv rydning, forvarmning, verifikation af udførelse og "
"tilbagerulning. Indbygget servercache har en separat overtagelsesvej."

msgid ""
"YPerf owns the prepared replacement layers. Another plugin’s activation "
"status was never changed by YPerf."
msgstr ""
"YPerf administrerer de forberedte erstatningslag. YPerf ændrede aldrig et "
"andet plugins aktiveringsstatus."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf persistent object cache is active. Redis round-trip and Runtime "
"Acceptance passed."
msgstr ""
"YPerfs vedvarende objektcache er aktiv. Redis-roundtrip og driftsgodkendelse"
" blev bestået."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf policy"
msgstr "YPerf-politik"

msgid ""
"YPerf prepared the handoff but will not deactivate W3 Total Cache. Open "
"Plugins, deactivate W3 Total Cache yourself, return here, then continue. "
"This keeps plugin activation status under your control."
msgstr ""
"YPerf forberedte overdragelsen, men deaktiverer ikke W3 Total Cache. Åbn "
"Plugins, deaktivér selv W3 Total Cache, vend tilbage hertil, og fortsæt "
"derefter. Det holder pluginaktivering under din kontrol."

msgid ""
"YPerf prepares a reversible handoff, then asks you to deactivate W3 Total "
"Cache yourself on the WordPress Plugins screen. After you return, YPerf "
"reconciles ownership, proves execution and runs Health Check. YPerf never "
"changes another plugin’s activation status."
msgstr ""
"YPerf forbereder en reversibel overdragelse og beder dig derefter selv "
"deaktivere W3 Total Cache på WordPress-skærmen Plugins. Når du vender "
"tilbage, afstemmer YPerf ejerskab, verificerer udførelse og kører "
"tilstandskontrol. YPerf ændrer aldrig et andet plugins aktiveringsstatus."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf preserves an OFF source intent and activates Page Cache only when that"
" responsibility actually needs a replacement."
msgstr ""
"YPerf bevarer kildens hensigt om FRA og aktiverer kun sidecache, når "
"ansvarsområdet faktisk kræver en erstatning."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf reads the provider configuration through its public runtime API. It "
"does not change W3TC settings."
msgstr ""
"YPerf læser udbyderkonfigurationen gennem dens offentlige drifts-API. "
"Programmet ændrer ikke W3TC-indstillinger."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf reads the zone settings and effective delivery state."
msgstr "YPerf læser zoneindstillingerne og den effektive leveringsstatus."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf recognizes the proven Nginx FastCGI cache as the authoritative page-"
"cache executor. No server configuration was changed."
msgstr ""
"YPerf genkender den verificerede Nginx FastCGI-cache som primær "
"sidecachemekanisme. Ingen serverkonfiguration blev ændret."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf refused to remove advanced-cache.php because its W3 Total Cache "
"ownership changed before write time."
msgstr ""
"YPerf afviste at fjerne advanced-cache.php, fordi dens ejerskab under W3 "
"Total Cache ændrede sig før skrivningen."

msgid ""
"YPerf replacement is ready; final plugin activation status remains a user "
"decision."
msgstr ""
"YPerf-erstatningen er klar; den endelige beslutning om pluginaktivering "
"ligger hos brugeren."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid "YPerf response policy active"
msgstr "YPerfs svarpolitik aktiv"

msgid "YPerf restored its own changes and left plugin activation status untouched."
msgstr ""
"YPerf gendannede sine egne ændringer og lod pluginaktiveringsstatus være "
"urørt."

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own migration changes. If you want W3 Total Cache active "
"again, reactivate it yourself from the WordPress Plugins screen."
msgstr ""
"YPerf gendannede sine egne migreringsændringer. Hvis du vil aktivere W3 "
"Total Cache igen, skal du selv genaktivere pluginet på WordPress-skærmen "
"Plugins."

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own migration changes. W3 Total Cache remains inactive "
"until the administrator chooses to reactivate it from Plugins."
msgstr ""
"YPerf gendannede sine egne migreringsændringer. W3 Total Cache forbliver "
"inaktiv, indtil administratoren vælger at genaktivere den under Plugins."

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own partial changes. Plugin activation status remains "
"under user control."
msgstr ""
"YPerf gendannede sine egne delvise ændringer. Pluginaktiveringsstatus "
"forbliver under brugerens kontrol."

#: includes/class-yperf-cloudflare-edge.php
msgid "YPerf restored the Cloudflare settings it had adopted."
msgstr "YPerf gendannede de Cloudflare-indstillinger, det havde overtaget."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf restored the previous ownership state and stopped before accepting the"
" handover."
msgstr ""
"YPerf gendannede den tidligere ejerskabsstatus og stoppede før godkendelse "
"af overdragelsen."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf restored the previous state, restored the retired W3TC responsibility "
"switches and reactivated W3 Total Cache."
msgstr ""
"YPerf gendannede den tidligere tilstand og de udfasede W3TC-"
"ansvarsindstillinger og genaktiverede W3 Total Cache."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf reverted every change made by this migration run, including the pre-"
"handover W3TC responsibility switches."
msgstr ""
"YPerf fortrød alle ændringer fra denne migreringskørsel, herunder W3TC-"
"ansvarsindstillingerne fra før overdragelsen."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf reverted the partial handover and restored the pre-handover provider "
"responsibility switches before returning control."
msgstr ""
"YPerf fortrød den delvise overdragelse og gendannede udbyderens "
"ansvarsindstillinger fra før overdragelsen, inden kontrollen blev givet "
"tilbage."

msgid "YPerf rollback complete."
msgstr "YPerfs tilbagerulning fuldført."

msgid ""
"YPerf rollback is complete. W3 Total Cache was not reactivated "
"automatically; WordPress.org requires that activation decision to remain "
"with you."
msgstr ""
"YPerfs tilbagerulning er fuldført. W3 Total Cache blev ikke genaktiveret "
"automatisk; WordPress.org kræver, at beslutningen om aktivering forbliver "
"hos dig."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf settings were imported and verified successfully."
msgstr "YPerf-indstillingerne blev importeret og verificeret."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf stopped after attempting the protected rollback, but one rollback "
"component could not be verified. The UI will not claim a complete rollback."
msgstr ""
"YPerf stoppede efter at have forsøgt beskyttet tilbagerulning, men én "
"tilbagerulningskomponent kunne ikke verificeres. Brugergrænsefladen påstår "
"ikke, at tilbagerulningen er fuldført."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf treats Redis/Valkey as bounded working memory with isolation, "
"maxmemory, hit/miss and eviction visibility."
msgstr ""
"YPerf behandler Redis/Valkey som afgrænset arbejdshukommelse med indsigt i "
"isolering, maxmemory, HIT/MISS og udsmidning af data."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf uses a site-specific namespace and generation-based cache invalidation"
" so rollback never requires deleting unrelated Redis data."
msgstr ""
"YPerf bruger et webstedsspecifikt navnerum og generationsbaseret "
"ugyldiggørelse af cache, så tilbagerulning aldrig kræver sletning af "
"uvedkommende Redis-data."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will not activate its portable Page Cache while an adopted native "
"executor owns page-cache authority. Review or release that adoption first if"
" you intentionally want to change executors."
msgstr ""
"YPerf aktiverer ikke sin flytbare sidecache, mens en overtaget indbygget "
"mekanisme administrerer sidecachen. Gennemgå eller frigiv først denne "
"overtagelse, hvis du bevidst vil skifte mekanisme."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "YPerf will not change an advanced-cache.php whose ownership is not proven."
msgstr "YPerf ændrer ikke en advanced-cache.php, hvis ejerskab ikke er verificeret."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will not enable database query caching just to increase a feature "
"count. It must prove a measurable benefit beside object cache and real "
"database indexes."
msgstr ""
"YPerf aktiverer ikke caching af databaseforespørgsler blot for at øge "
"antallet af funktioner. Der skal kunne påvises en målbar fordel sammen med "
"objektcache og reelle databaseindekser."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will not send a credential until the HTTPS endpoint, authentication "
"mode, workspace header and Writer transport all pass the local contract "
"gate."
msgstr ""
"YPerf sender ingen loginoplysninger, før HTTPS-endepunkt, "
"godkendelsesmetode, arbejdsområdeheader og Writer-transport alle har bestået"
" den lokale aftalekontrol."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid "YPerf will preserve cart, checkout, account and session bypass rules."
msgstr "YPerf bevarer reglerne for BYPASS af kurv, kasse, konto og session."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will save the exact local diff and the post-apply Runtime Acceptance "
"result."
msgstr ""
"YPerf gemmer den præcise lokale ændringsoversigt og resultatet af "
"driftsgodkendelsen efter anvendelse."

#: includes/class-yperf-migration-journey.php
msgid "YPerf-owned replacement responsibilities were activated and proved."
msgstr ""
"Erstatningsansvarsområder, som YPerf administrerer, blev aktiveret og "
"verificeret."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YSEO"
msgstr "YSEO"

